SUMMARY:Mark West Area Chamber of Commerce Monthly Social
DESCRIPTION:When: September 10\, 2026 \nTime: 5:30 PM – 7:30 PM \nWhere: Treasure House Consignment Shop | 3450E Airway Dr.\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95403 \nFree Attendance: We warmly invite the community to join us for FREE to network while enjoying food and beverages provided by our host. \n\n\nPlease RSVP:  Confirming your planned attendance helps our host plan accordingly for food and beverage. \nWhy You Should Attend? \n\n\n\n\nGather Insights: Learn firsthand from fellow attendees about trends\, opportunities\, and challenges that affect our local economy and businesses. \nExpand Your Circle: Connect with professionals across industries in a relaxed and welcoming environment. \nInspiring Conversations: Get involved in meaningful discussions and leave each luncheon feeling inspired and motivated. \nMark Your Calendar\, Invite a Friend & Join Us!  \nEvery month brings new opportunities to bring businesses and the greater community together to connect. \nPlease invite a friend to join us so they too can see how the Mark West Area Chamber can help promote their business!
URL:https://markwest.org/event/mark-west-area-chamber-of-commerce-monthly-social-4/
LOCATION:Treasure House Consignment Shop\, 3450 Airway Dr e\, Santa Rosa\, CA\, 95403\, United States
ORGANIZER;CN="Mark West Chamber of Commerce":MAILTO:office@markwest.org
