SUMMARY:Multi-Chamber Mixer - October
DESCRIPTION:When: Thursday\, October 15\, 2026 \nTime: 5:30 PM – 7:30 PM \nVenue Host Location: \nDescription: \n16 local Chambers of Commerce are collaborating in an effort to bring our community together for quarterly mixers and we are thrilled that recent Multi-Chamber Mixers have welcomed 200+ community members and business leaders for an evening of networking and learning more about local business from across Sonoma County. \nThis is a fantastic opportunity to expand your network\, share ideas\, and collaborate with professionals from various industries.​ \nHighlights: \nComplimentary appetizers and refreshments​ \nDoor prize raffle \nAdmission: \nThis event is free to attend and open to all. Bring yourself\, a guest\, and your business cards!​ \nRegistration: \nWhile registration is not mandatory\, it helps us prepare accordingly. Please register to let us know you’re coming.​ \nDoor Prize Raffle Donation: \nWe invite you to showcase your business with the submission of a door prize to be included in the drawing. Pre-collection of your planned donation helps us plan ahead for the display of donated items and in preparation for the display poster(s) that will list the donating businesses and the winners at the event. Please complete the form to confirm your interest in participating with at least one door prize donation so that we can plan accordingly for the drawing. \nContact Information: \nFor any questions\, please contact your Chamber of Commerce or one of the hosting Chambers. \nDon’t miss this opportunity to connect with fellow chamber members and grow your professional network. We look forward to seeing you there!​
URL:https://markwest.org/event/multi-chamber-mixer-october/
ORGANIZER;CN="Mark West Chamber of Commerce":MAILTO:office@markwest.org
END:VEVENT
